Hi Tomek,

I’ve been using the default parameters shown in CODEX’s demo code and vignettes and haven’t encountered problems. I suggest keep the defaults. Definitely try different number of latent factors K though — this will have a bigger impact on the number of copy number calls.

Yuchao

